- github.com/bourama1/etf_landing_page/blob/master/data/sources.md: earlier runs got **404**; `curl https://github.com/bourama1/etf_landing_page` → 404: **the repository is private**, so the "Zdroje" link on every page is broken for visitors until Matěj makes the repo public (the brief requires a public repo anyway). The 429 above is GitHub rate-limiting repeated checks.
- conversionxl.com, newsroom.morningstar.com, 4× invesco.com PDFs: `curl -L` with a browser user agent → 200 for all (they refuse Node's fetch, not browsers).
